  ('838-004-332', 3.38::numeric, 3.65::numeric, null::numeric, 'Sakib Ahamed', null::date, null::date, null::date, 'declined', '2026-07-09'::date, null::boolean, 'Request to Update PO:90450082 Price', '2026-06-09'::date, 'The $3.65 request went to Dulcey Benham (6/9, 6/10, 6/17, 6/22, 7/8) and reached Skye by forward, so there is no email to Skye with a send date. Skye replied 7/9 that her system and the March 2025 confirmation from Leo both say $3.38. On 7/13 you wrote to Skye that $3.38 is correct. No effective date was ever given. Confirm with Leo before asking again.', $j$[{"date":"2026-06-09","who":"Sakib Ahamed","text":"Asked Dulcey Benham to review 838-004-332 at $3.65 (was $3.38) on PO 90450082. Repeated 6/10, 6/17, 6/22 and 7/8."},{"date":"2026-07-09","who":"Skye Ingraham","text":"The email you attached is from January 2025; her last email (March 2025, Leo) confirmed $3.38, the price in the system."},{"date":"2026-07-13","who":"Sakib Ahamed","text":"Apologised to Skye, said $3.38 is correct and that you will check price changes with Leo first."}]$j$::jsonb)
